flowchart TD
    Arrow[Arrow bar store] --> GetData[GetData: normalize and closed bars]
    Parquet[Local Parquet] --> GetData
    GetData --> IPC[Atomic IPC disk cache and bounded RAM cache]
    IPC --> Raw[Single-flight raw loads and stable content versions]
    Raw --> Producers[Versioned producer LRU: 256 MiB]
    Producers --> DAG[Native expression DAG; opaque kernels eager]
    Raw --> Target[Versioned shared target: 16 MiB]
    DAG --> Join[Requested features and optional target join]
    Target --> Join
    Join --> Results[Atomic frame and lazy payload LRU: 128 MiB]
    Results --> JSON[Native JSON encoding on data requests]
    JSON --> Data[GET /data]
    Results --> Select[QC column selection, dates and row grouping]
    Select --> Worker[Research process: one active and one queued job]
    Raw --> Checkpoint[Resumable factory checkpoints on disk]
    Checkpoint --> Pool[Memory-mapped catalog and view pools]
    Pool --> Worker
    Worker --> Cohort[Exact retained-row cohorts; request-local 64 MiB workspace]
    Cohort --> QC[Shared ranks and MI preparation; allocation-free bootstrap draws]
    Worker --> Context[Verified context content; exact compact ranks: 256 MiB]
    Context --> Analysis[Shared null masks; Float64 FFT tiles; analysis: 16 MiB]
    Analysis --> Discover[Exact AUC count kernel; current-snapshot rules: 16 MiB]
    QC --> QCAPI[GET /qc]
    Discover --> FindAPI[POST /discover]
